Separately installed campus speed-test component
------------------------------------------------

The optional campus speed-test component is a separately downloaded and
executed derivative of LibreSpeed CLI v1.0.13 (commit
2f2408764d88e9601aa64a03b340f8e3151003e4), licensed under LGPL-3.0. It is
not linked into the soundconnect binary. The component applies the
checked-in progress-JSON and explicit SOCKS5 patches. Its pinned source archive
SHA-256 is 5ad938b61e3edc0ca95e2ccff0c06e97a69383f3cbb0243bd47b21b9865f9f55.
Every component release must include the unchanged upstream license, both
patches, source provenance, and a corresponding-source download.

